  "limits_ja": [
    "2020配布版内の2成分・6問い合わせの探索的な照合です。旧2017評価と版間対応試験は変更しません。",
    "同じBroad/L1000基盤の既存実験の再処理で、問い合わせの元実験は使用済みです。盲検・独立施設の検証ではありません。",
    "成分と測定グループの交絡は未解決で、遺伝子位置の入替えでも分離できません。",
    "二択の単独1位率とMRRは独立した裏付けではありません。理論的ランダム期待値は実測対照ではありません。",
    "対象にできる化学形で構造グラフと記載full InChIKeyの両方が対応するのは2成分です。ほかの成分の無効判定ではありません。",
    "食品・治療・健康な状態への回復・人体で届く量は未検証で、タンパク質78条件とは未接続です。"
  ],
  "limits_en": [
    "An exploratory two-label, six-query comparison within the 2020 release; the old 2017 evaluation and stopped cross-release trial remain unchanged.",
    "Existing experiments were reprocessed on the same Broad/L1000 platform; underlying query experiments were used previously. This is neither blind nor independent-facility validation.",
    "Compound and measurement-group effects remain confounded; permuting gene positions does not separate them.",
    "Two-way unique top-1 and MRR are not independent corroboration. Theoretical random expectations are not measured controls.",
    "Two eligible exact forms meet both structure-graph and reported full-InChIKey checks. Other constituents were not judged ineffective.",
    "Food/treatment effects, healthy-state restoration and achievable human exposure are untested; the 78-condition protein catalog is unconnected."
  ]
